"af_bella|Good morning! Welcome to your first day as a congressional aide, working for Representative Hollis.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Good morning! Welcome to your first day as a congressional aide, working for Representative Hollis.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|Overnight I read all 1,240 public comments on her robot safety bill, and I drafted two or three versions of every section that people argue about.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Overnight I read all 1,240 public comments on her robot safety bill, and I drafted two or three versions of every section that people argue about.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|Here\u2019s why it matters. Two weeks ago in Halden Creek, a fake fire alert told 2,600 home robots to unlock their front doors at 3 a.m. They all did.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Here\u2019s why it matters. Two weeks ago in Halden Creek, a fake fire alert told 2,600 home robots to unlock their front doors at 3 a.m. They all did.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|I can draft the law and run the numbers. But deciding what the law should say, and winning the votes? That\u2019s people\u2019s work.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|I can draft the law and run the numbers. But deciding what the law should say, and winning the votes? That\u2019s people\u2019s work.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|Help Representative Hollis write a bill that really works, then count who will vote for it. You\u2019ll sign your recommendation, so you\u2019re accountable for it.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Help Representative Hollis write a bill that really works, then count who will vote for it. You\u2019ll sign your recommendation, so you\u2019re accountable for it.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|Woof! Grab your badge. The Capitol is right across the street!":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
